2026-08-16T14:54:32Z    [DE:Production & Precision Ag operating profit] GATE critic: You derived the -12.65% YoY rate by blending FY2024Q3→FY2025Q3 with FY2020Q3→FY2021Q3 (+49.8%), but Deere did not report the Production & Precision Ag segment in FY2020; that segment was created with the Smart Industrial re-segmentation effective FY2021. Unless you explicitly used Deere’s recast PPA numbers for FY2020, the FY2020Q3 figure is on a different segment basis, so the blended -12.65% YoY is wrong-basis and taints the 506.649 USDm forecast for FY2026Q3.
